# Release drop folder

After completing **features**, **bug fixes**, or **UI changes** in NewTowerRelay, run a release build into the drop folder before finishing.

## Drop location

`~/Desktop/NewTowerBuilds` (override with `DROP_DIR` env var)

## Command

```bash
cd /Users/jon/Documents/Code/Rust/NewTowerRelay
chmod +x scripts/drop-release.sh
./scripts/drop-release.sh
```

This produces Mac SKUs, `NewTowerRelay.app`, and a Linux `.deb` when Docker is available.

## When to skip

- Docs-only or comment-only edits
- Work-in-progress the user explicitly asked not to build yet
